---
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="页面未找到 | code2art museum" description="请求的 code2art museum 页面不存在。">
  <main class="page-shell not-found-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / Not found</p>
    <h1>这条档案路径还不存在</h1>
    <p>它可能已移动、尚未公开，或仍等待被社群补充。</p>
    <div class="form-actions">
      <a class="button-primary" href="index.html">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button-quiet" href="archive/index.html">检索档案</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

